        "bazel/config/BUILD.bazel": "Adds a new `rhel10_ppc64le_gcc_linkstatic` config_setting_group matching linux + ppc64le + gcc + rhel10 + linkstatic_enabled.",
        "bazel/resmoke/resmoke.bzl": "Adds C++ coverage plumbing to the resmoke test rule. Adds a module docstring and loads find_cpp_toolchain/use_cpp_toolchain. Sets COVERAGE_GCOV_PATH and LLVM_COV in the launcher env from the resolved cc toolchain, injects a runtime LLVM_PROFILE_FILE override (server-%p-%m%c.profraw using continuous/per-module mode) when COVERAGE_DIR is set, and forwards instrumented_files_info from the server_deps/data attributes. Introduces a `_coverage_dso_transition` that appends the `llvm_coverage_dso` feature to server_deps only under coverage, adds `_cc_toolchain`/`_lcov_merger`/`_collect_cc_coverage` attrs, and declares cpp/coverage fragments and the cpp toolchain on the rule. Server binaries are no longer added to the py_test `deps`; the cc toolchain files are added to runfiles. Also removes some explanatory comments.",
